# ==============================================================================
# LegalMetrix AI — Environment Configuration Overview
# ==============================================================================
# LegalMetrix AI uses separate environment files for backend and frontend services.
# Please refer to and copy the respective example files:
#
# 1. Backend Service:
#    Copy `backend/.env.example` -> `backend/.env`
#    Configure DATABASE_URL, SECRET_KEY, CORS_ORIGINS, and OCR settings.
#
# 2. Frontend Application:
#    Copy `frontend/.env.example` -> `frontend/.env`
#    Configure VITE_API_BASE_URL (defaults to http://localhost:8000).
# ==============================================================================
